{{quote|Ugh, I'm not [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]], I'm a seafood platter. Mmm, and apparently one possessed of a highly advanced intellect. Ergo, perhaps I should assign this new life-form a more apropos nom de guerre. What say...  '''Brainstorm!'''|Brainstorm's first words.<ref name="Pier">''[[Pier Pressure]]''</ref>}}
'''Brainstorm''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Cerebrocrustacean]]<ref>[[Driba]]</ref><ref name="TFoW2">''[[The Frogs of War: Part 2]]''</ref> from the planet [[Encephalonus IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Brainstorm Bandai Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = Bandai1}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Brainstorm===
Brainstorm has a rust-colored [[Wikipedia:Crab|crab]]-like appearance with pincers for hands. He can open his skull plates at will to reveal his huge, corrugated brain, which is pink in color.

In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Brainstorm had six legs and wore a silver and black neck brace with the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on it.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', Brainstorm looked mostly the same except his shell was a more vibrant orange and his skull plates were black.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Brainstorm has a black loincloth with a green stripe in the center of it on the bottom of his body. He also has a black stripe in the center of his head with a green stripe running across it. He now has four legs instead of six, and each leg has a single joint instead of two, with a black stripe on each one. The spines on Brainstorm's face and forehead are now longer, and his eyes connect to a large black strip that extends around his forehead. He also has two spikes on each elbow, and he wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on a white and green neck brace.

===Albedo as Negative Brainstorm===
In '''Ultimate Alien''', [[Albedo|Negative]] Brainstorm looked just like [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Brainstorm in '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''' except his eyes were recolored red and he lacked an Ultimatrix symbol.

In '''Omniverse''', Negative Brainstorm looks just like Ben's Brainstorm in the same series, except his shell is recolored puce, his teeth are recolored pale yellow, his eyes and shell stripes are recolored red, and he wears a red [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on a red and white neck brace.

