==Personality==
Brainstorm usually speaks with very high vocabulary, which can make it difficult for others to understand what he is talking about.<ref>''[[What Are Little Girls Made Of?]]''</ref> He can also come off as arrogant and egotistical due to his intelligence, as according to him, he has skill, not luck.<ref name="TV">''[[The Vengers]]''</ref><ref name="VoVP2">''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]''</ref>

